WEBVTT

00:00:05.860 --> 00:00:07.440
The team is still split up,

00:00:07.440 --> 00:00:10.550
and the situation is desperate both in the sky and on the ground.

00:00:11.390 --> 00:00:17.050
But the moronic kindness of the one that was always with me

00:00:17.050 --> 00:00:23.620
and the teachings of the person who beat power and technique into my useless self

00:00:23.620 --> 00:00:26.650
are telling me to stand and fight.

00:00:27.700 --> 00:00:30.020
Those words she said to me, “Don’t lose to anyone...”

00:00:30.870 --> 00:00:33.030
The time I spent,

00:00:33.030 --> 00:00:35.000
the future I believed in...

00:00:35.910 --> 00:00:38.780
I can’t let those dreams be dreams.

00:00:59.810 --> 00:01:05.960
The things that I can do for you and no one else

00:01:05.960 --> 00:01:11.660
I honestly feel and wish for those

00:01:11.660 --> 00:01:18.380
I am frozen by uncertainties

00:01:18.380 --> 00:01:24.620
By the rules I have been relying on

00:01:24.620 --> 00:01:30.320
My past embellished with excuses

00:01:30.320 --> 00:01:34.520
I want to get over it

00:01:34.520 --> 00:01:37.800
Staining the stars in heaven scarlet

00:01:37.800 --> 00:01:41.270
Gather the grains of miracles

00:01:41.270 --> 00:01:44.530
Before the still, unseen night

00:01:44.530 --> 00:01:47.810
I want to tell you that I am escaping from illusions

00:01:47.810 --> 00:01:50.990
The twilight moon calls out to me

00:01:50.990 --> 00:01:54.080
Removing my veil of delusions

00:01:54.080 --> 00:01:57.290
My hidden, deceitful self

00:01:57.290 --> 00:02:01.170
And took all of my weaknesses

00:02:01.170 --> 00:02:07.630
I don’t want words that seem passionate

00:02:07.630 --> 00:02:17.050
The fact that I’m here right now is my truth

00:02:40.710 --> 00:02:42.540
Target point is near.

00:02:54.100 --> 00:02:58.800
She’s the mother of that small girl, right?

00:03:00.520 --> 00:03:02.490
I’ve got nothing against you, but...

00:03:04.410 --> 00:03:06.510
Five.

00:03:06.510 --> 00:03:08.370
Four.

00:03:08.370 --> 00:03:10.330
Three.

00:03:10.330 --> 00:03:12.250
Two.

00:03:12.250 --> 00:03:12.940
One.

00:03:12.940 --> 00:03:14.360
<b>Excelion...</b>

00:03:14.360 --> 00:03:15.500
Zero.

00:03:15.500 --> 00:03:16.810
<b>...Buster</b>

00:03:28.460 --> 00:03:32.690
Blaster System: limit 1, release!

00:03:32.690 --> 00:03:34.380
Blaster set.

00:03:36.260 --> 00:03:40.220
Booster shoot!

00:04:02.830 --> 00:04:06.490
This kind of power right off the bat...

00:04:08.890 --> 00:04:12.330
Is she even human?

00:04:14.230 --> 00:04:15.930
Stay put.

00:04:15.930 --> 00:04:20.900
The Assault Team will secure you
and take you to a safe place.

00:04:20.900 --> 00:04:23.130
Sealing

00:04:24.070 --> 00:04:27.640
We’re going to stop this ship.

00:04:44.680 --> 00:04:46.080
Master.

00:04:46.090 --> 00:04:47.290
I’m fine.

00:04:47.290 --> 00:04:49.790
Maintain Blaster 1.

00:04:49.790 --> 00:04:51.990
We need to hurry, Raising Heart.

00:04:51.990 --> 00:04:52.910
All right.

00:05:01.100 --> 00:05:02.320
Oh, come on.

00:05:02.320 --> 00:05:10.030
I heard the name “Blaster System” and thought it was some advanced, incredible technology, but that’s just stupid.

00:05:10.030 --> 00:05:15.350
Hey, Your Majesty? Your mom’s an idiot.

00:05:23.410 --> 00:05:25.250
Welcome.

00:05:25.250 --> 00:05:27.340
We’ve been waiting.

00:05:28.300 --> 00:05:31.490
Thanks for coming all this way, even though it was totally pointless.

00:05:31.490 --> 00:05:37.560
Now then, your companions are being beaten all over the world.

00:05:43.180 --> 00:05:47.140
You’re under arrest
for a large-scale disturbance of the peace!

00:05:47.140 --> 00:05:50.330
You will cease and disarm immediately.

00:05:50.330 --> 00:05:53.780
Your friends are all in danger, your kid’s in trouble,

00:05:53.780 --> 00:05:56.400
and you’re still thinking about your job?

00:05:56.400 --> 00:06:00.960
How nice! That almost demonic sense of justice.

00:06:03.960 --> 00:06:08.180
But I wonder if you can still stay calm.

00:06:11.260 --> 00:06:12.200
Vivio?

00:06:20.690 --> 00:06:22.630
Let me tell you something interesting.

00:06:22.860 --> 00:06:29.970
It was <i>this</i> girl who destroyed the transport truck
and the Gadgets when she was still asleep in her pod.

00:06:29.980 --> 00:06:34.280
And that attack of Dieci’s that took everything you had to block?

00:06:34.280 --> 00:06:40.700
If she had been hit by it,
it wouldn’t have slowed her for a second.

00:06:40.700 --> 00:06:44.370
That’s the unique skill of the Ancient Belkan royal family,

00:06:44.370 --> 00:06:46.820
the Armor of the Holy King.

00:06:46.820 --> 00:06:51.990
By joining with the Relics to achieve full power,

00:06:51.990 --> 00:06:58.410
which the Ancient Belkan royalty created by
altering their own bodies into the ultimate bio-weapons.

00:06:58.410 --> 00:07:00.680
Her power as a Relic Weapon.

00:07:00.680 --> 00:07:01.670
Mama!

00:07:01.670 --> 00:07:02.580
Vivio!

00:07:02.890 --> 00:07:04.580
Mama!

00:07:04.580 --> 00:07:06.010
No! Mama!

00:07:06.010 --> 00:07:08.210
Vivio! Vivio!

00:07:11.110 --> 00:07:13.250
With the power of the <i>Cradle</i> added to her own,

00:07:13.250 --> 00:07:15.290
our king will be complete soon,

00:07:15.290 --> 00:07:19.010
and she will be invincible.

00:07:19.010 --> 00:07:20.270
The ultimate warrior.

00:07:20.950 --> 00:07:22.190
Mama!

00:07:22.190 --> 00:07:23.610
Vivio!

00:07:44.340 --> 00:07:45.660
Mama.

00:07:45.660 --> 00:07:49.340
Oh my, Your Majesty. Don’t cry.

00:07:49.340 --> 00:07:53.340
Your mother wants you to save her, Your Majesty.

00:07:53.340 --> 00:07:57.810
The scary devil who kidnapped her
is right in front of you, Your Majesty.

00:07:58.610 --> 00:08:03.100
Do your best to kick the crap out of her
and get your real mother back.

00:08:04.030 --> 00:08:08.320
You have the power to do that now, Your Majesty.

00:08:09.210 --> 00:08:14.400
Release that power you maintain in your heart and emotions.

00:08:17.890 --> 00:08:19.080
Vivio!

00:08:47.450 --> 00:08:52.660
You took my mama somewhere.

00:08:52.660 --> 00:08:55.090
Vivio, no, it’s me!

00:08:55.090 --> 00:08:56.260
It’s Mama Nanoha!

00:08:58.080 --> 00:08:58.680
No!

00:09:00.010 --> 00:09:01.320
Liar!

00:09:02.100 --> 00:09:06.580
You aren’t my mama!

00:09:09.940 --> 00:09:13.600
Give me back my mama!

00:09:13.600 --> 00:09:14.420
Vivio!

00:09:16.230 --> 00:09:21.970
If you can stop her, you might be able to stop the <i>Cradle.</i>

00:09:22.900 --> 00:09:24.650
Raising Heart.

00:09:24.650 --> 00:09:26.850
W.A.S., full driving.

00:09:28.280 --> 00:09:32.950
Now then, kill each other like a good mother and daughter.

00:09:32.950 --> 00:09:35.370
Give me back my mama!

00:09:35.370 --> 00:09:37.570
Booster limit 2!

00:09:41.460 --> 00:09:46.440
Yes, the city’s defensive line is holding up for now.

00:09:46.440 --> 00:09:49.640
We can deal with the Gadgets.

00:09:49.640 --> 00:09:50.620
Yes, sir.

00:09:50.620 --> 00:09:54.060
The members of our squad that your redhead trained

00:09:54.060 --> 00:09:59.300
and Miss Takamachi’s students in
the A.A.S. are maintaining the front lines.

00:09:59.300 --> 00:10:01.360
But we’re at our limit.

00:10:01.360 --> 00:10:03.610
We can’t send any additional forces elsewhere,

00:10:03.610 --> 00:10:09.460
and if the combat cyborgs or that summoner show up,
we may go down instantly.

00:10:09.460 --> 00:10:15.760
Five of the combat cyborgs and that one summoner are fighting Riot Force 6’s front-line troops.

00:10:15.760 --> 00:10:17.720
I see.

00:10:30.400 --> 00:10:32.000
There’s so many.

00:10:32.000 --> 00:10:36.010
Your shooting and your illusion magic is all worthless!

00:10:36.620 --> 00:10:38.690
She’s pretty tough.

00:10:38.690 --> 00:10:39.940
But if she can keep running

00:10:39.940 --> 00:10:42.380
until her backup comes,
we could be in trouble!

00:10:42.380 --> 00:10:44.410
We need to hurry up, kill her,
and move on to the next one!

00:10:46.530 --> 00:10:47.620
Found her.

00:10:56.200 --> 00:10:58.270
They’ve confirmed our position.

00:10:58.270 --> 00:11:00.280
They are bearing down on us at 3 o’clock.

00:11:00.920 --> 00:11:05.340
Shooter and silhouette control is okay.
Maintain present status.

00:11:05.340 --> 00:11:07.550
All that’s left is to take them out here.

00:11:07.550 --> 00:11:08.710
Yes.

00:11:10.600 --> 00:11:16.730
I can’t run, and I’m almost out of mana and cartridges.

00:11:16.730 --> 00:11:21.660
I’m not sure if trying a final fight
with the last of them will work.

00:11:24.650 --> 00:11:29.160
To be honest, I’ve known for a while.

00:11:29.160 --> 00:11:36.090
No matter how hard I try, I’ll never be a first-class mage.

00:11:36.090 --> 00:11:40.540
It hurt, it was pathetic, and I didn’t want to accept it.

00:11:40.540 --> 00:11:43.760
That hasn’t really changed, but...

00:11:45.670 --> 00:11:46.950
But still...

00:11:50.180 --> 00:11:51.260
Twin Dagger

00:12:01.820 --> 00:12:03.680
An illusion?

00:12:20.750 --> 00:12:22.020
She’s not running?

00:12:22.020 --> 00:12:23.430
Is this a trap?

00:12:23.430 --> 00:12:26.740
There’s no doubt... she’s the real one.

00:12:26.740 --> 00:12:28.890
Yes, she is.

00:12:28.890 --> 00:12:30.990
Don’t underestimate her.

00:12:30.990 --> 00:12:33.810
We’ll all rush her at once and take her out.

00:12:34.690 --> 00:12:38.970
I knew it. The same positioning as the first time.

00:12:38.970 --> 00:12:41.640
That’s the one hole in their strategy.

00:12:41.640 --> 00:12:44.560
It’s a perfect but simple combination.

00:12:44.560 --> 00:12:48.300
If I can hit at the exact instant their combination strikes...

00:13:10.850 --> 00:13:13.030
Oh, Subaru?

00:13:13.030 --> 00:13:14.020
What’s wrong?

00:13:14.020 --> 00:13:16.370
Mom!

00:13:16.370 --> 00:13:17.690
Ginga!

00:13:17.690 --> 00:13:20.460
My, my. You slipped, didn’t you?

00:13:22.570 --> 00:13:23.780
Hey, Subaru.

00:13:23.780 --> 00:13:26.700
Don’t cry just because you tripped.

00:13:26.700 --> 00:13:30.470
You’re my daughter and Ginga’s little sister.

00:13:31.160 --> 00:13:33.930
You’re actually a strong girl, Subaru.

00:13:39.040 --> 00:13:43.710
The results from the test are undeniable.

00:13:43.710 --> 00:13:50.640
Your genetic structure is identical
to both Subaru’s and Ginga’s.

00:13:50.640 --> 00:13:56.560
We think that your genetic data was stolen somewhere and used.

00:13:57.570 --> 00:13:58.210
I see.

00:14:15.200 --> 00:14:20.410
You should practice Shooting Arts more, Subaru.

00:14:20.410 --> 00:14:23.630
I don’t like pain and scary stuff.

00:14:24.540 --> 00:14:34.010
I don’t like being hurt myself,
but I hate hurting or scaring others more.

00:14:34.010 --> 00:14:38.190
Our bodies aren’t normal.

00:14:38.190 --> 00:14:42.860
I’m scared of breaking something I don’t want to.

00:14:44.560 --> 00:14:45.420
I see.

00:14:46.280 --> 00:14:49.730
Well, you might not need to be strong, Subaru.

00:14:49.730 --> 00:14:53.940
Mom and Dad are here, and so am I.

00:14:53.940 --> 00:14:56.860
Okay!

00:15:07.590 --> 00:15:11.570
Cease resistance and shut down.

00:15:14.470 --> 00:15:16.890
A change in operational specifics.

00:15:23.400 --> 00:15:27.780
Damage until out of commission and then recover.

00:15:28.430 --> 00:15:29.700
Ginny!

00:15:45.920 --> 00:15:49.340
It was impossible, after all.

00:15:49.340 --> 00:15:58.370
I guess I’m weak and pathetic,
and it’s going to end with me not being able to do anything.

00:15:59.770 --> 00:16:04.690
By the way, why did you want to get stronger, Subaru?

00:16:04.690 --> 00:16:08.840
Oh! Well, that’s... because I really look up to you, Nanoha.

00:16:09.630 --> 00:16:12.590
Well, that makes me happy and all, but I mean,

00:16:13.430 --> 00:16:17.330
what do you want to do if you get stronger?

00:16:32.880 --> 00:16:34.220
Wingroad

00:16:36.920 --> 00:16:38.780
Caliber Shot, left turn!

00:16:40.550 --> 00:16:41.910
Shoot it!

00:16:58.650 --> 00:17:00.930
Just as rehearsed.

00:17:01.530 --> 00:17:03.120
Mach Caliber?

00:17:03.120 --> 00:17:06.100
We can still take actions, you and I.

00:17:07.240 --> 00:17:10.160
We can still fight, so why are you giving up like this?

00:17:11.330 --> 00:17:14.140
You taught me the reason of my being here,

00:17:14.140 --> 00:17:18.380
your aspiration to grow stronger.

00:17:18.380 --> 00:17:20.830
Don’t make everything a lie.

00:17:22.260 --> 00:17:28.300
When a war or a disaster, something bad like that happens,

00:17:28.300 --> 00:17:35.890
I want to be able to save people
who are sad, in pain, and shouting “Save me!”

00:17:35.890 --> 00:17:40.120
To take them straight to someplace safe, by my own power.

00:17:43.120 --> 00:17:52.000
To be honest, I’m always scared and uneasy about fighting,
about hurting somebody... my hands always shake.

00:17:52.000 --> 00:17:55.850
But this power in my hands isn’t to destroy.

00:17:55.850 --> 00:17:57.840
It’s to protect.

00:17:58.970 --> 00:18:01.990
The power to break through a sad situation.

00:18:04.980 --> 00:18:06.850
Let’s go, Mach Caliber!

00:18:07.010 --> 00:18:08.300
All right, buddy!

00:18:11.900 --> 00:18:13.060
Full Drive...

00:18:13.060 --> 00:18:14.020
...Ignition!

00:18:16.450 --> 00:18:18.380
<b>Gear Excelion</b>

00:18:19.900 --> 00:18:22.740
A.C.S., standby.

00:18:32.540 --> 00:18:36.520
That helicopter is shooting down the Gadgets?

00:18:44.720 --> 00:18:49.380
You’re the commander of the land battle and the one in charge of all the barriers.

00:18:49.380 --> 00:18:54.610
You were well-hidden,
but you can’t get away from Klarwind’s sensor.

00:18:54.610 --> 00:18:59.050
On suspicion of a large-scale disturbance of the peace,
as well as the attack on Riot Force 6...

00:19:04.730 --> 00:19:06.450
You’re under arrest.

00:19:07.620 --> 00:19:09.040
Otto.

00:19:12.000 --> 00:19:14.690
Otto got taken down, huh?

00:19:14.690 --> 00:19:15.660
Yeah.

00:19:18.130 --> 00:19:19.280
Why, you...!

00:19:23.460 --> 00:19:23.800
Now!

00:19:49.620 --> 00:19:51.770
Wendi, Deed!

00:19:56.880 --> 00:20:00.550
You’re all under arrest.

00:20:00.550 --> 00:20:03.690
Safety your weapons and lay them on the ground.

00:20:07.640 --> 00:20:10.660
Let’s go, Ginny!

00:21:07.160 --> 00:21:10.890
With a single blow!

00:21:26.300 --> 00:21:27.990
<b>Divine...</b>

00:21:31.170 --> 00:21:33.120
<b>...Buster</b>

00:21:44.740 --> 00:21:46.810
Knight Zest has entered HQ.

00:21:46.810 --> 00:21:48.180
This is bad!

00:21:52.620 --> 00:21:55.930
Auris, I order you to evacuate.

00:21:55.930 --> 00:21:57.960
No, <i>you</i> will.

00:21:57.960 --> 00:22:01.280
You have no authority anymore.

00:22:01.280 --> 00:22:03.630
You should have no reason to be here.

00:22:03.630 --> 00:22:07.800
I <i>must</i> be here.

00:22:10.720 --> 00:22:15.180
Sorry for the rough entrance, Regius.

00:22:15.180 --> 00:22:17.670
I don’t care, Zest.

00:22:18.850 --> 00:22:21.820
Zest?

00:22:26.030 --> 00:22:28.550
I won’t let you go any farther!

00:22:28.550 --> 00:22:29.490
You’re...!

00:22:29.490 --> 00:22:31.690
Sir Zest won’t do anything bad.

00:22:31.690 --> 00:22:35.400
He just wants to talk with an old friend.

00:22:35.400 --> 00:22:38.320
Sir Zest doesn’t have any time left.

00:22:38.320 --> 00:22:40.270
If you’re going to get in his way, then...

00:22:47.170 --> 00:22:51.090
Our plan has always been
to ask you what the situation was.

00:22:51.090 --> 00:22:55.060
If it’s got to do with what’s going on, then even more so.

00:22:55.060 --> 00:22:57.230
We need to hear it.

00:22:57.230 --> 00:23:00.370
Is Auris your adjutant?

00:23:00.370 --> 00:23:03.210
She’s smart but selfish.

00:23:03.210 --> 00:23:05.400
She hasn’t changed since she was a kid.

00:23:05.400 --> 00:23:07.880
I’ve just got one question.

00:23:08.700 --> 00:23:16.640
Was it on <i>your</i> orders that my men and I were killed eight years ago?

00:23:17.950 --> 00:23:22.620
What about the justice of ours that we spoke of?

00:23:22.620 --> 00:23:25.050
Where is it now?

00:23:34.840 --> 00:23:40.770
In my precious days

00:23:52.900 --> 00:23:56.540
“The bluebird ran away”

00:23:58.380 --> 00:24:01.990
I cried, embracing the empty cage

00:24:04.710 --> 00:24:09.490
I still remember the color of the high-rising sky

00:24:10.150 --> 00:24:12.900
That I looked up at that day

00:24:15.950 --> 00:24:19.350
Rewinding

00:24:21.400 --> 00:24:24.830
Inside my memories

00:24:25.590 --> 00:24:30.630
In painful times, in happy times

00:24:30.630 --> 00:24:35.890
You were always there at important times

00:24:36.310 --> 00:24:42.240
The thing which I looked for to the ends of the labyrinth

00:24:42.240 --> 00:24:46.660
Is deep within my heart

00:24:46.660 --> 00:24:52.890
Etched into this amulet, these precious times

00:24:52.890 --> 00:24:57.930
Soft and secret pieces of my memory

00:24:57.930 --> 00:25:04.140
No matter what type of tomorrow it is, I can walk towards it

00:25:04.140 --> 00:25:09.790
In my precious days

00:25:17.150 --> 00:25:20.230
Scars that won’t go away,
and pain that won’t stop.

00:25:20.230 --> 00:25:22.860
To take them straight on
without running away.

00:25:22.860 --> 00:25:27.040
Because you taught us, we can.

00:25:32.680 --> 00:25:35.990
With guts, take off!
